<title>HONG KONG: National Mutual Asia interim profit rises.</title>
<headline>National Mutual Asia interim profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   27.15    vs 24.49</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    7.8	vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    589.28   vs 529.30</p>
<p>    Total premium revenue    2,494.58 vs 2,256.40</p>
<p>    Company name		 National Mutual Asia Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 23-27</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   August 22</p>
<p>NOTE - National Mutual Asia is 56 percent directly and indirectly held by Australian insurer National Mutual Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
